{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christian Graces; Final Greetings"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Masters, give your bondservants what is just and fair, knowing that you also have a Master in heaven."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christian Graces"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Continue earnestly in prayer, being vigilant in it with thanksgiving; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "meanwhile praying also for us, that God would open to us a door for the word, to speak the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "hidden truth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "mystery of Christ, for which I am also in chains, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that I may make it manifest, as I ought to speak."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Walk in wisdom toward those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " outside, redeeming the time. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Let"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your speech always "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with grace, seasoned with salt, that you may know how you ought to answer each one."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Final Greetings"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Tychicus, a beloved brother, faithful minister, and fellow servant in the Lord, will tell you all the news about me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I am sending him to you for this very purpose, that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU you may know our circumstances and he may comfort"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "he may know your circumstances and comfort your hearts, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "with Onesimus, a faithful and beloved brother, who is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of you. They will make known to you all things which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are happening"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " here."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Aristarchus my fellow prisoner greets you, with Mark the cousin of Barnabas (about whom you received instructions: if he comes to you, welcome him), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and Jesus who is called Justus. These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are my"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " only fellow workers for the kingdom of God who are of the circumcision; they have proved to be a comfort to me."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Epaphras, who is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of you, a bondservant of Christ, greets you, always laboring fervently for you in prayers, that you may stand perfect and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU fully assured"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "complete in all the will of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I bear him witness that he has a great "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU concern"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "zeal for you, and those who are in Laodicea, and those in Hierapolis. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Luke the beloved physician and Demas greet you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Greet the brethren who are in Laodicea, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Nympha"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nymphas and the church that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU her"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "his house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Closing Exhortations and Blessing"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when this epistle is read among you, see that it is read also in the church of the Laodiceans, and that you likewise read the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "epistle"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from Laodicea. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And say to Archippus, “Take heed to the ministry which you have received in the Lord, that you may fulfill it.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This salutation by my own hand—Paul. Remember my chains. Grace "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}